# Applies to services/forge/frontend/Dockerfile only (BuildKit reads
# <dockerfile>.dockerignore ahead of the context root's .dockerignore). Kept per-Dockerfile
# so it cannot change what the Python service builds send, which share the same root context.
#
# node_modules is the important one twice over: it is ~300 MB per app, and the copies on this
# machine hold macOS-native binaries that would break inside a Linux image.
**/node_modules
**/.nuxt
**/.output
**/dist
.git
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
*.pdf
